            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-59197",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Pillow: Pillow: Native heap out-of-bounds write"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Pillow is a Python imaging library. Prior to 12.3.0, Pillow's public rank-filter API can trigger a native heap out-of-bounds write when given a very large odd filter size because ImageFilter.RankFilter.filter() calls image.expand(size // 2, size // 2) before rank-filter size validation and ImagingExpand() computes output dimensions with unchecked signed int arithmetic. This issue is fixed in version 12.3.0."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-59197",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-59197\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: Pillow\nFixed Version: 12.3.0\nLink: [CVE-2026-59197](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-59197)\nPillow is a Python imaging library. Prior to 12.3.0, Pillow's public rank-filter API can trigger a native heap out-of-bounds write when given a very large odd filter size because ImageFilter.RankFilter.filter() calls image.expand(size // 2, size // 2) before rank-filter size validation and ImagingExpand() computes output dimensions with unchecked signed int arithmetic. This issue is fixed in version 12.3.0.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-59197**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|Pillow|12.3.0|[CVE-2026-59197](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-59197)|\n\nPillow is a Python imaging library. Prior to 12.3.0, Pillow's public rank-filter API can trigger a native heap out-of-bounds write when given a very large odd filter size because ImageFilter.RankFilter.filter() calls image.expand(size // 2, size // 2) before rank-filter size validation and ImagingExpand() computes output dimensions with unchecked signed int arithmetic. This issue is fixed in version 12.3.0."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 8.2,
                "cvssv3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:H",
                "precision": "very-high",
